=== WHAT THIS PROVES (the pinned negative path) ===
Requesting a (gpu, op, shape) the tuning DB has NO entry for must fail GRACEFULLY:
the Runtime returns a clear, actionable typed error and exits non-zero. It must NEVER
serve a wrong kernel (e.g. a sibling gpu's or a different shape's variant) and must
NEVER crash. The launcher is never invoked on a miss (asserted by the GPU-free gtest
runtime.MissReturnsClearErrorAndDoesNotServe: launcher.calls == 0).

=== [1] On-GPU miss: request an untuned shape on the detected gpu ===
